.th PTBANNER VI 24/8/77
.sh NAME
ptbanner \*- make a p/t banner
.sh SYNOPSIS
.it ptbanner
[ "string" ... ]
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it ptbanner
writes it's arguments on it's standard output
in paper tape human readable form.
If there are no arguments, it reads from it's standard input.
96 character set available.
